----------------------------------------------------------------------
Network mirror services used at runtime (no code bundled, HTTPS only)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

12) Bangbang93 BMCLAPI2 mirror (used as the Chinese-mainland download mirror)
    - Endpoint: https://bmclapi2.bangbang93.com
    - License:  No code or resource bundle is distributed inside this
                repository. The launcher talks to BMCLAPI2 over HTTPS
                according to the mirror's public API contract; please
                follow the upstream mirror's terms of service.
    - Notes:    When the user switches the in-launcher "download source"
                to "BMCLAPI", every loader / resource / library request
                is routed through BMCLAPI2 (Fabric / Quilt / LiteLoader
                metadata + artifacts, Forge maven, Mojang assets and
                libraries).

13) MCBBS download mirror
    - Endpoint: https://download.mcbbs.net
    - License:  Same as BMCLAPI2 above — runtime HTTPS requests only,
                no code or resource bundle distributed.
    - Notes:    Used when the user picks "MCBBS" as the download source.


